---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: canceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_position: investedCapital[msg.sender] > 0
    q_check_position --> q_check_not_refunded: position not already refunded
    q_check_not_refunded --> q_load_amount: amount = investedCapital[msg.sender]
    q_load_amount --> q_mark_refunded: mark position as refunded
    q_mark_refunded --> q_transfer: bidToken.transfer(msg.sender, amount)
    q_transfer --> [*]: emit CapitalWithdrawn event

    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_active: auction not canceled
    q_revert_active --> [*]: revert AuctionNotCanceled
    q_check_position --> q_revert_no_pos: no invested capital
    q_revert_no_pos --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_not_refunded --> q_revert_refunded: already refunded
    q_revert_refunded --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded

    note right of q_mark_refunded
        INV-001: refund equals exact invested amount (no partial refunds)
        INV-002: each position can only be refunded once
        INV-003: only callable when auction is in canceled state
    end note
